ocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d6DdR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4c5d447-a4c0-4a2b-bfdd-5ce21b80d2db","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ちゃんとしたオーブンがあるなら、そっちのほうが楽ちんかも。","ts":"1634082476.111200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nGT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"097714c4-c810-461d-b832-bbc37c65af5b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"コンロやオーブンの方がらくなのでどうしてもそっち使ってしまう","ts":"1634082453.110800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k48Yb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ab0d84c-16a9-4a47-80fa-2340b4b347d8","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"うちの電子レンジはめちゃくちゃぽんこつなやつで使うのがめんどうでめったに使っていない...","ts":"1634082434.110400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cLD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d5222a7-8296-485a-abfb-12c20784afc3","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね、どんどんやろう","ts":"1634082413.109600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"prAS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81881caa-d5c0-4e8e-b486-4682e4be331e","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"家でパンを焼ける人も多かろう。やるかどうかは別として","ts":"1634082407.109400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TQm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d74c3cb7-323a-45b0-802e-fba618664980","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"日本でも電子レンジがオーブンの役目をしていることもあるので","ts":"1634082385.108900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"++N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74982f97-53dd-4071-b013-6388105cdc28","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただどうしてもコンロ自体のサイズでほかが圧迫されるので、料理ガジェットが増えてくると作業場がなくなって、なくなくコンロの上でおそるおそる作業したりします。","ts":"1634082374.108600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_origin